      {
        "urlText": "Buses replace trains between Olympic Park and Lidcombe",
        "url": "https://transportnsw.info/alerts/details#/ems-80978",
        "content": "<div><strong>Monday 9 November</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>From 11.40pm to 1am</strong>, buses replace trains between Olympic Park and Lidcombe.<br /><br /></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/trip#/trip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Plan your trip</a> before you travel for up-to-date real time information. You can also subscribe to <a href=\"https://transportnsw.info/travel-info/ways-to-get-around/train/about-trackwork#subscribe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">planned trackwork alerts</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<div><strong>Bus route</strong></div>\n<div>40T7&nbsp; Olympic Park, Lidcombe and return</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><strong>Replacement buses</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Most replacement buses accept Opal. Tap on and off with a valid Opal or contactless card. Fines apply without a valid ticket.</li>\n<li>Bikes aren&rsquo;t allowed on replacement buses. Use a nearby bike shed or locker.</li>\n<li>Services may be delayed or cancelled due to driver shortages. We're working to minimise disruption and keep journeys safe.</li>\n</ul>",
        "subtitle": "Buses replace trains between Olympic Park and Lidcombe",
        "smsText": "Buses replace trains between Olympic Park and Lidcombe",
        "speechText": "Monday 9 November\nFrom 11:40PM to 1AM, buses replace trains between Olympic Park and Lidcombe.\nPlan your trip before you travel for up-to-date real time information. You can also subscribe to planned trackwork alerts.\nBus route\n40T7  Olympic Park, Lidcombe and return"
      }
    ],
